        "original_id": "258d319d-e21c-51a3-bb5e-7d6eb7300979",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Jon Wright, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Films: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston\n- Topics: British child actors, film directing, screenwriting\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- Robot Overlords, originally titled Our Robot Overlords, is a 2014 British independent science fiction film.\n- Jon Wright directed and co-wrote Robot Overlords.\n- Robot Overlords stars Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails is a 2015 German-Austrian-Irish comedy film.\n- Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails stars Anke Engelke, Milo Parker, and Bastian Pastewka as the voice of Hugo.\n- Milo Parker is known for playing Connor in Robot Overlords, Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes, and Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.",
